===Noun===
'''[[w:Mandelbrot|Mandelbrot]] [[set]]'''

# {{mathematics}} a set of [[complex number]]s, C, for which the [[iteration]] z<sub>n+1</sub> = z<sub>n</sub><sup>2</sup> + C has a [[finite]] [[limit]]; a [[graph]] of this set having each value of the finite limit in a different [[colour]] - the [[boundary]] of this graph is a [[fractal]]

